WEBVTT

00:31:57.746 --> 00:32:01.246
And I think the main difference is

00:32:01.454 --> 00:32:04.996
the fact that at some point
in our evolution,

00:32:04.996 --> 00:32:07.704
we developed this way of
speaking with words

00:32:08.163 --> 00:32:11.371
so that we can teach children about
things that aren't present.

00:32:12.288 --> 00:32:17.329
We can gather together and discuss
something people from different views.

00:32:17.621 --> 00:32:22.913
And that is what I believe led to this
explosive development of our intellect,

00:32:23.121 --> 00:32:25.913
which is what really does
make us different.

00:32:25.913 --> 00:32:30.121
So animals are way, way, way more
intelligent than many people used to